  "description": "The tow-behind spike aerator boasts 11 star-shaped, galvanized plug core knives, each 8 inches in diameter with 12 points. These spike aerator knives can penetrate the soil up to 2 inches deep, allowing water, seeds, and nutrients to effectively reach the roots and enhance plant life.\nFeatures\nUpgraded Lawn Aerator: YITAMOTOR tow behind spike aerator boasts 11 star-shaped galvanized plug core knives, each 8 inches in diameter with 12 points; These spike aerator can penetrate the soil up to 2 inches deep, allowing water, seeds, and nutrients to reach the roots effectively and enhancing plant life\nUniversal HItch Tow Bar: The atv lawn aerator features a wide, channel-shaped steel tow bar, which support to add strength and prevents flexing during turns; This penetrator innovation ensures maximum stability and durability, enhancing the lifespan of the aerator\n10\" Transport Wheels: YITAMOTOR tow behind plug aerator has 2 x 10\" pneumatic tyres, consisting of rubber tyres and iron spikes. And the aeration also equips with side control handle, which is convenient to use the single lever to engage the turf-tread transport wheels to cross driveways and sidewalks with ease\nEnhenced Materials: The spike aerator is made of Q235 alloy steel, which can resist bending and anti-rust to keep its life.The air aerator is all-steel design, including reinforced side plates and a 5/8-inch solid steel axle; Also added nylon spacers between each coring plug, increasing durability and ensuring a longer product life\nWeight Tray Capacity: YITAMOTOR lawn aerator has a rigid weight tray,which can hold up to 150 pounds of extra weight; This added weight allows for maximum soil penetrating and aeration depth, ensuring your soil is thoroughly aerated for optimal plant growth",
